@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### ==========================================
### 1. SYSTEM & AUTHENTICATION FLOW
### ==========================================

### 1A. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1B. Register Fresh Demo User (Run once during live demo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Engineering Lead",
  "email": "review.demo@figzol.com",
  "password": "Password@2026"
}

### 1C. Login Demo User (Auto-captures JWT token)
# @name loginDemo
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "review.demo@figzol.com",
  "password": "Password@2026"
}

### 1D. Get Current Authenticated Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDemo.response.body.token}}


### ==========================================
### 2. CORE CRUD + LIVE OPEN-METEO WEATHER
### ==========================================

### 2A. Create Plan #1 (Auto-captures Plan ID & fetches live weather)
# @name primaryPlan
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDemo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Backend Architecture & API Review",
  "city": "Lahore",
  "plan_date": "2026-11-25",
  "notes": "Demonstrate MVC layers, JWT middleware, and SQLite schema"
}

### 2B. Create Plan #2 (Second city for list comparison)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDemo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cloud Deployment Planning",
  "city": "Tokyo",
  "plan_date": "2026-12-02",
  "notes": "Evaluate production hosting and environment secrets"
}

### 2C. Read All Plans for Logged-In User
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDemo.response.body.token}}

### 2D. Read Single Plan by ID (Fetches fresh live weather snapshot)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/{{primaryPlan.response.body.plan.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDemo.response.body.token}}

### 2E. Update Plan City & Details (Triggers fresh weather lookup for London)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/plans/{{primaryPlan.response.body.plan.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDemo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "International Engineering Sync",
  "city": "London",
  "plan_date": "2026-12-05",
  "notes": "Updated city triggers automatic Open-Meteo re-fetch"
}


### ==========================================
### 3. SECURITY & EDGE-CASE VERIFICATION
### ==========================================

### 3A. Edge Case: Duplicate Email Registration (Expected: 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate Tester",
  "email": "review.demo@figzol.com",
  "password": "Password@2026"
}

### 3B. Security: Missing Authorization Header (Expected: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans

### 3C. Security: Tampered / Invalid JWT Token (Expected: 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.invalidpayload.tampered

### 3D. Security: Cross-User Isolation / IDOR Check (Register & Login User B)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "External User B",
  "email": "intruder.b@figzol.com",
  "password": "Password@2026"
}

###
# @name loginIntruder
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "intruder.b@figzol.com",
  "password": "Password@2026"
}

### User B attempts to read Demo User's Plan ID (Expected: 404 Plan not found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/{{primaryPlan.response.body.plan.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginIntruder.response.body.token}}

### 3E. Edge Case: Missing Required Fields (Expected: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDemo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Incomplete Plan Without City or Date"
}

### 3F. Edge Case: Non-Existent City Geocoding Lookup (Expected: 404 Not Found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDemo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unknown Destination",
  "city": "AtlantisNonExistentCity999",
  "plan_date": "2026-12-15"
}

### 3G. Edge Case: Unmatched API Endpoint (Expected: 404 Route not found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/non-existent-route


### ==========================================
### 4. CLEANUP / DELETE OPERATION
### ==========================================

### 4A. Delete Primary Plan (Expected: 200 Plan deleted successfully)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/plans/{{primaryPlan.response.body.plan.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDemo.response.body.token}}

### 4B. Verify Deleted Plan No Longer Exists (Expected: 404 Plan not found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/{{primaryPlan.response.body.plan.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDemo.response.body.token}}